; rose-pro - original 22-DOF humanoid, structure in 3 mm 5052 sheet.
;
; Not a K1 clone. An original layout designed around MyActuator X-series
; envelopes, verified against the vendor drawings (pro/SIZING.md catalogue):
;
;   X15-450 D166 x 69(+3), stator 12xM5 on D157, output 12xM5 on D100, D144 flange
;   X12-320 D124 x 85(+3), stator 16xM4 on D116.5, output 12xM5 on D72, D109 flange
;   X10-200 D124 x 63.5(+2), same faces as X12
;   X8-120  D96 x 76(+3), stator 10xM3 on D88, output 12xM4 on D55
;   X6-60   D80 x 67.5, stator 12xM3 on D72.5, output 12xM4 on D44, D53 spigot
;   X4-36   D55 x 61, stator 6xM3 on D48, output 6xM3 on D26
;
; Structure is cut-and-bent sheet: laser blanks + press brake + bolts. Couplings
; are one blank where the bend line clears both bolt circles, two bends with a
; corner relief where it crosses one, and two lapped pieces where it lands inside
; a circle (hip roll, ankle, shoulder). See pro/rose_pro_bent.py for the
; per-coupling determination.
;
; 1800 mm cut (2026-08-19): X15-450 hip pitch and knee, X12 / X10 hip roll and
; yaw, X8 ankle and shoulder pitch; ~68 kg design mass (SIZING.md). Chest over a
; closed pelvis pod, thigh jogged back to the knee, hemmed windows, arms as
; channels (UNITREE.md "H2, measured"). The 1173 mm body on X6/X4 that stood at
; +0.0% ground-force error is commit 6999477; this one has not been stood yet.
;
; Generated by pro/rose_pro_loon.py in the rose repo - edit the table there.


[defparam hip_y      94.0000 :unit "mm"]
[defparam shoulder_y 255.0000 :unit "mm"]
[defparam sheet_t    3.0000 :unit "mm"]
[defparam bend_r     1.5 :unit "mm"]

; Every link is a MODULE in links/ (its lets are its exports; its own
; roots stay there). This file imports them and declares the roots. The
; plate vocabulary is plates.loon, next to this file or on VCAD_LOON_PATH.
[material "actuator" 0.10 0.10 0.11 0.6 0.5]

